OL,3,GNEWSA'We need to listen to children and
OL,4,Ashow we care'                          
OL,6,FThe new Children's Champion for the    
OL,7,FIsle of Man has said getting young     
OL,8,Fpeople's voices heard is at the heart  
OL,9,Fof the role.                           
OL,11,FKirsty Morphet MLC, who worked in      
OL,12,Fsocial care for 26 years, has been     
OL,13,Fappointed by the chief minister, with a
OL,14,Ffocus on children in the care system.  
OL,16,FMorphet said she was "very passionate  
OL,17,Fabout ensuring the needs of young      
OL,18,Fpeople are met and that they are met in
OL,19,Fthe most appropriate way possible".    
