OL,3,GNEWSA'We need to listen to children and
OL,4,Ashow we care'                          
OL,6,FShe said her "absolute priority" was to
OL,7,Fcreate meaningful participation and to 
OL,8,F"demonstrate by action" that the       
OL,9,Fgovernment "does care and does want to 
OL,10,Ftake young people's views into         
OL,11,Faccount".                              
